@startuml
title Goal State Machine

hide empty description

[*] --> Active : create

Active --> Completed : complete
Completed --> Completed : complete [idempotent]
Active --> Archived : archive
Completed --> Archived : archive
Archived --> Active : restore

Archived -[#red]-> Completed : complete [400 INVALID_TRANSITION]
Active -[#red]-> Active : restore [400 INVALID_TRANSITION]
Completed -[#red]-> Completed : restore [400 INVALID_TRANSITION]

note right of Archived
  Missing goal: 404 NOT_FOUND
  Restore clears CompletionDate.
end note

@enduml
